he"}}, {"environment": {"00": "ecosystem", "01": "nature", "10": "surroundings", "11": "habitat"}}], "container": "Environmental conservation and sustainable living are crucial aspects of our society today. It is our responsibility to protect and preserve our environment for future generations. Sustainable living involves making conscious choices to reduce our carbon footprint and minimize waste. This can be achieved through practices such as recycling, using renewable energy sources, and conserving water. Additionally, it is important to promote biodiversity and protect endangered species by preserving natural habitats. By adopting a sustainable lifestyle, we can create a more eco-friendly world and ensure the long-term survival of our planet. It is imperative that we all work together to make a positive impact on the environment.", "encoded_message": "Ecological management and renewable existence exist essential features of community's civilization these days. It represents our obligation to safeguard and conserve our natural world for coming descendants. Eco-conscious living requires taking intentional decisions to decrease our CO2 impact and reduce trash. The aforementioned may exist attained through techniques like as reusing, utilizing regenerative energy resources, and preserving water. Moreover, it is significant to foster biological diversity and defend at-risk species by preserving natural habitats. By adopting a sustainable lifestyle, we can create a more eco-friendly world and ensure the long-term survival of our planet. It is imperative that we all work together to make a positive impact on the environment.", "encoding_time_report": {"container_generation": 2.85, "secret_key_generation": 118.85}, "decoding_time": 0.0003409385681152344, "decoded_message": "0101110011111111010000100000111000100101110010010101110100100011", "error_message": ""}